  "description": "DRN.Framework.EntityFramework provides DrnContext with conventions to develop rapid and effective domain models.  \n  \n## Commit Info  \nAuthor: Duran Serkan KILIÇ  \nDate: 2026-09-19 11:48:23 +0300  \nHash: 8530f8a6466ea915d41f4d32f68c9c1972cc284c",
